                    },
                    "message": "Why not use contained?  I'm trying to understand the need for a new adjective."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/PCIeFunction.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 159,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thang Tran",
                        "email": "thuutran@amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "thangtran-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "I considered about `contained`, but when I check the Redfish specification, the description of PCIeFunctions property in PCIeDevice is `An array of links to PCIe functions exposed by this device`, refer to https://redfish.dmtf.org/schemas/v1/PCIeDevice.v1_19_0.json. That why I use `exposed_by`.\n\n\nNote: Even this property has been deprecated and replaced with `PCIeFunctionCollection`, but I think the association between PCIeDevice and PCIeFunction should be `exposing - exposed_by`"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/PCIeFunction.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 161,
                    "reviewer": {
